msgid "U575 MPU-v2 scalar GPIO WRITE authority"
msgstr "U575 MPU-v2 scalar GPIO WRITE authority"

msgid "This implementation reference selects STM32U575ZIT6Q TZEN0, MSIS4, one security world, FreeRTOS MPU-wrapper-v2 and the actual Cortex-M33 eight-region port. One protected task may WRITE GPIOC PC7 through one immutable grant. Software evidence now includes real C host models, a normal M33 reset link and one relocated development-SDK consumer with the maintained static ELF gate. Runtime MPU exception behavior and electrical HIL are not executed. It establishes no M7 MPU support or general user-device gateway."
msgstr "本实施参考选择 STM32U575ZIT6Q TZEN0、MSIS4、单一 security world、FreeRTOS MPU-wrapper-v2 及实际 Cortex-M33 八 region port。一个受保护 task 可通过一个不可变 grant WRITE GPIOC PC7。软件证据现包括真实 C host 模型、normal M33 reset 链接，以及经过维护静态 ELF gate 的单个搬移 development-SDK consumer。未执行 runtime MPU 异常行为及电气 HIL。它不建立 M7 MPU 支持或通用 user-device gateway。"

msgid "Link the selected `Nexus::U575MpuGpio` target through the maintained [assembly](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/u575-mpu-gpio-write.toml). The ordinary profile keeps the pinned 70-entry syscall numbering and delay/tick services. Only `user_io=\"gpio-write\"` selects the 71-entry derivation, new slot 70 and protected task pin/epoch fields. Resource claims apply only to measured compiled contexts and actual images; the [source-bound evidence](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/testing/evidence/u575-mpu-gpio-20261020/README.md) keeps selected/default scope and historical phases explicit."
msgstr "通过维护的[装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/u575-mpu-gpio-write.toml) 链接所选 `Nexus::U575MpuGpio` target。普通 profile 保留锁定的 70 项 syscall 编号及 delay/tick 服务。仅 `user_io=\"gpio-write\"` 选择 71 项派生、新 slot70 及受保护 task 的 pin/epoch 字段。资源结论仅适用于实际测量的编译上下文和镜像；[源码绑定证据](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/testing/evidence/u575-mpu-gpio-20261020/README.md) 明确区分 selected/default 范围与历史阶段。"

msgid "![FIG-29: exact protected task, immutable authority and one guarded BSRR effect; close/join precede task deletion; software links do not establish runtime isolation](../assets/diagrams/u575-mpu-gpio.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-29：精确受保护 task、不可变 authority 及一次 guard 内 BSRR 效果；task delete 前先 close/join；软件链接不建立 runtime 隔离](../assets/diagrams/u575-mpu-gpio.svg)"

msgid "FIG-29: exact protected task, immutable authority and one guarded BSRR effect; close/join precede task deletion; software links do not establish runtime isolation"
msgstr "FIG-29：精确受保护 task、不可变 authority 及一次 guard 内 BSRR 效果；task delete 前先 close/join；软件链接不建立 runtime 隔离"

msgid "The {ref}`figure contract <fig-29-u575-mpu-gpio>` distinguishes actual calls, protected authority, saved-mask exclusion and lifecycle responsibility. No arrow creates a worker, dynamic handle registry, user MMIO mapping or asynchronous request protocol."
msgstr "{ref}`图合同 <fig-29-u575-mpu-gpio>` 区分实际调用、受保护 authority、保存掩码后的排除边界及生命周期责任。任何箭头均不创建 worker、动态 handle registry、user MMIO 映射或异步 request 协议。"

msgid "Five explicit memory domains"
msgstr "五个显式内存域"

msgid "The maintained normal memory generator accepts five explicit, nonempty, 32-byte-aligned reservations. Their Flash and RAM sums may be less than the physical capacity; the remaining tail stays unassigned, rather than becoming user memory. Overflow, overlap, malformed sizes and insufficient privileged MSP/static budget are rejected before generation. These are software reference reservations, not a product partition policy."
msgstr "维护的 normal memory generator 接受五个显式、非空、32 B 对齐的预留区。其 Flash 和 RAM 总量可小于物理容量；余下尾部保持未分配，不成为 user memory。溢出、重叠、非法大小及不足的 privileged MSP/static 预算在生成前被拒绝。这些是软件参考预留，不是产品分区政策。"

msgid "Domain"
msgstr "域"

msgid "Reference reservation"
msgstr "参考预留"

msgid "Contents and access"
msgstr "内容与访问"

